-- title:
--   Equal traces of every real power of the two Gram operators
-- statement:
--   Let $H$ be a finite-dimensional complex Hilbert space, let $A$ be any operator on $H$, and let $t\in\mathbb R$. Then
--   $$ \operatorname{Tr}((A^*A)^t)=\operatorname{Tr}((AA^*)^t). $$
--   The totalized spectral powers include singular Gram operators and negative $t$, with $0^t=0$ for $t\ne0$ and $0^0=1$. This gives adjoint-side invariance of the spectral trace expressions used in Schatten estimates.
